
Bind Npc 32285

On greeting
    If player level > 69
        Say "Would you like to enter into the Krowaz's Land? If the party leader applies for the entrance, all the party members can enter into the same area at one scoop. Otherwise, everybody enters individually."
        Topic "I'll just go." goto event_102
        Topic "No, I'll just go." goto close
    Else
        Say "Sorry, but only Level 70 players or higher can enter Krowaz's Land."
        Topic "Confirm" goto close
    Goto close

On event_102
    If krowaz is open
        If player leads a party
            Teleport party to 75 at 55 1974
        Else
            Teleport 75 at 55 1974
    Else
        Say "Currently you may not enter the Krowaz. Krowaz entry times are from 14:00 to 15:00."
        Topic "Confirm" goto close
